after all these years, he is still annoyed.
这么多年过去了，他依然对此感到恼火。

974
00:41:57.780 --> 00:41:58.920
He still remembers.
他还记得呢。

975
00:41:59.060 --> 00:42:01.120
He's like, oh, those silks, those silks.
他就像是，噢，那些丝绸，那些丝绸。

976
00:42:02.360 --> 00:42:09.860
I also thought this is when I think the fact that both Randall Einhorn and Matt Sohn had
我还觉得，兰德尔·艾因霍恩和马特·索恩都曾担任过《幸存者》的摄像师，

