01:02:11.740 --> 01:02:16.480
And then we're just going to move that cringe meter right back on over across the parking
然后我们要把尴尬指数计重新移回停车场，

1460
01:02:16.480 --> 01:02:20.260
lot because Jim is about to start the next game, which is, who would you do?
因为吉姆要开始下一个游戏了，就是“你会选谁？”

1461
01:02:20.680 --> 01:02:22.300
Why would they play this?
他们为什么要玩这个？

1462
01:02:22.560 --> 01:02:23.020
Why?
为什么？

1463
01:02:23.080 --> 01:02:24.400
It's a horrible idea.
这主意太烂了。

1464
01:02:24.860 --> 01:02:25.640
It's a horrible idea.
这主意太烂了。

1465
01:02:26.240 --> 01:02:28.580
Kevin and Oscar immediately say, Pam.
凯文和奥斯卡脱口而出：“帕姆。”

1466
01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:29.460
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1467
01:02:29.840 --> 01:02:35.480
And while this is happening, Dwight is clearly just sad that Michael's spending so much time
就在这时，德怀特显然因为迈克尔花太多时间陪瑞安而感到难过，

1468
01:02:35.480 --> 01:02:40.620
with Ryan because now he's sitting in his car loudly listening to, Everybody Hurts.
因为他现在正坐在车里大声听着《Everybody Hurts》。

1469
01:02:40.620 --> 01:02:44.640
Yes, he's listening to R.E.M.'s Everybody Hurts.
没错，他在听R.E.M.乐队的《Everybody Hurts》。

1470
01:02:45.020 --> 01:02:49.860
And Kent shared with me that it cost us $14,000 to play that song.
肯特告诉我，播放这首歌花了我们14000美元。

1471
01:02:50.280 --> 01:02:51.760
Just that one song?
就这一首歌？

1472
01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:52.240
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1473
01:02:52.740 --> 01:02:53.680
Holy moly.
天哪。

1474
01:02:53.860 --> 01:02:54.080
Yeah.
是啊。

1475
01:02:54.320 --> 01:02:56.640
Everybody does hurt in their pocketbook.
每个人的钱包确实都在“受伤”。

1476
01:02:58.180 --> 01:02:58.700
Sorry.
抱歉。

1477
01:02:58.940 --> 01:02:59.700
I'm sorry.
对不起。

1478
01:02:59.860 --> 01:03:00.860
I'm turning into Josh.
我快变成乔什了。

1479
01:03:01.060 --> 01:03:01.900
This is like a dad joke.
这简直是冷笑话。

1480
01:03:02.020 --> 01:03:02.880
That was a dad joke.
那确实是个冷笑话。

1481
01:03:04.040 --> 01:03:09.060
And, Lady, we talked about this in our original breakdown, but I just want to bring it back
而且，女士，我们在最初的解析里谈过这个，但我还是想再提一下。

1482
01:03:09.060 --> 01:03:09.500
up again.
我不喜欢这一幕里的吉姆和帕姆。

1483
01:03:10.340 --> 01:03:13.880
I don't like Jim and Pam in this scene.
他们在取笑德怀特。

1484
01:03:14.020 --> 01:03:15.340
They're making fun of Dwight.
确实。

1485
01:03:15.480 --> 01:03:16.040
They are.
是的。

1486
01:03:16.140 --> 01:03:16.320
Yeah.
没错。

1487
01:03:16.540 --> 01:03:17.360
And they are mean.
他们很刻薄。

1488
01:03:17.360 --> 01:03:19.140
I'm just saying it again.
我只是再说一遍。

1489
01:03:19.260 --> 01:03:19.540
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1490
01:03:19.540 --> 01:03:24.980
But I didn't love Jim and Pam in this whole episode.
但我整集都不太喜欢吉姆和帕姆。

1491
01:03:25.400 --> 01:03:29.400
I kind of thought that they were being too cool for school.
我觉得他们表现得太自命不凡了。

1492
01:03:29.740 --> 01:03:33.260
They were laughing at other people's expense a lot.
他们经常以取笑别人为乐。

1493
01:03:33.940 --> 01:03:39.080
This was so early for me to kind of like turn on them in this way.
这么早就让我对他们产生这种反感，实在太早了。

1494
01:03:39.280 --> 01:03:44.360
But in re-watching this, I was like, hmm, I'm not loving it, guys.
但重看这一集时，我心想：嗯，伙计们，我不太喜欢这样。

1495
01:03:44.720 --> 01:03:45.200
I know.
我知道。

1496
01:03:45.200 --> 01:03:46.700
It's the too cool for school thing.
就是那种自命不凡的感觉。

1497
01:03:46.900 --> 01:03:48.180
I don't care for that.
我不喜欢那样。

1498
01:03:48.420 --> 01:03:50.320
Let people like what they like.
让人家喜欢他们喜欢的东西吧。

1499
01:03:50.520 --> 01:03:52.300
Let them like whatever movies they like.
让他们喜欢他们想看的任何电影吧。

1500
01:03:52.400 --> 01:03:53.320
Let them be happy.
让他们开心点吧。

1501
01:03:53.780 --> 01:04:00.240
We did have a comment about this scene where Jim and Pam go over to Dwight from Kristen W.
我们收到了一条关于吉姆和帕姆去找德怀特那场戏的评论，来自加利福尼亚州帕萨迪纳的克里斯汀·W。

1502
01:04:00.400 --> 01:04:01.660
in Pasadena, California.
加利福尼亚州帕萨迪纳。

1503
01:04:02.540 --> 01:04:06.340
She says, were John and Jenna braking when they were talking to Dwight in his car?
她说，约翰和珍娜在车里和德怀特说话时是在憋笑吗？

1504
01:04:07.000 --> 01:04:10.940
Did Rain improvise the line about Ryan dying in the war?
关于瑞安死在战争中的那句台词是雷恩即兴发挥的吗？

1505
01:04:11.100 --> 01:04:15.060
It looked like they were all trying to stop laughing and then just keep going on with the scene.
看起来他们都在努力忍住不笑，然后继续演下去。

1506
01:04:15.200 --> 01:04:17.020
Kristen, that was all scripted.
克里斯汀，那全是剧本写好的。

1507
01:04:17.600 --> 01:04:19.260
Ryan in the war was scripted.
瑞安死在战争中那段也是剧本写的。

1508
01:04:19.360 --> 01:04:25.360
And it was also scripted that Pam and Jim were trying to suppress laughter as they talked to Dwight.
而且帕姆和吉姆在和德怀特说话时努力忍住笑也是剧本安排的。

1509
01:04:25.600 --> 01:04:26.120
Yes.
没错。

1510
01:04:26.380 --> 01:04:27.720
Because they're laughing at him.
因为他们在嘲笑他。

1511
01:04:27.720 --> 01:04:36.560
I feel like I remember it was a hard choice for me because Rain's performance is kind of heartbreaking.
我记得当时对我来说这很难抉择，因为雷恩的表演让人有点心碎。

1512
01:04:37.040 --> 01:04:43.740
Like it was a little hard for me to justify that my character was taking joy in this.
我觉得要为我的角色在这种情况下感到开心找理由有点难。

1513
01:04:43.740 --> 01:04:51.560
But I tried to remind myself, hey, this guy is really irritating to us a lot.
但我试着提醒自己，嘿，这家伙平时真的很烦人。

1514
01:04:52.140 --> 01:04:55.260
Like he's difficult to be around in the office.
在办公室里和他相处很困难。

1515
01:04:55.260 --> 01:04:59.320
But, you know, the Jenna inside of me is like, it doesn't matter.
但是，你知道，我内心深处的珍娜觉得，这不重要。

1516
01:04:59.320 --> 01:05:00.840
You just don't laugh at people.
你就是不能嘲笑别人。

1517
01:05:01.280 --> 01:05:01.640
I know.
我知道。

1518
01:05:01.800 --> 01:05:03.260
Not when they're hurting like that.
尤其是在他们那样难过的时候。

1519
01:05:03.580 --> 01:05:03.880
No.
没错。

1520
01:05:04.680 --> 01:05:15.980
And Angela, I know from our own personal experience in Hollywood, the thing that irritates us the most is when we run into the too cool for schools.
安吉拉，根据我们在好莱坞的亲身经历，最让我们恼火的就是遇到那些自命不凡的人。

1521
01:05:16.480 --> 01:05:17.640
Oh, my gosh.
天哪，真是。

1522
01:05:17.840 --> 01:05:19.220
Get over yourself already.
别再自我感觉良好了。

1523
01:05:19.860 --> 01:05:21.320
Get over yourself.
别再自以为是了。

1524
01:05:21.640 --> 01:05:23.800
When we're like at an event or something.
就像我们在参加活动的时候。

1525
01:05:23.980 --> 01:05:24.160
Yeah.
是啊。

1526
01:05:24.460 --> 01:05:30.180
And you're trying to talk to someone and they're just looking over your shoulder to see if the next best person is going to come in the room.
你想和某人说话，而他们却越过你的肩膀看有没有更重要的人进场。

1527
01:05:30.680 --> 01:05:33.360
And then they say snarky comments.
然后他们还会说些尖酸刻薄的话。

1528
01:05:34.140 --> 01:05:36.160
Oh, just please.
噢，拜托。

1529
01:05:36.560 --> 01:05:37.600
You play pretend.
大家都是在演戏而已。

1530
01:05:38.840 --> 01:05:39.320
Exactly.
没错。

1531
01:05:39.960 --> 01:05:42.220
We're not solving the world's problems here.
我们又不是在解决世界难题。

1532
01:05:42.540 --> 01:05:43.840
Just be nice.
友善一点就好。

1533
01:05:44.020 --> 01:05:44.520
Be nice.
友善一点。

1534
01:05:44.620 --> 01:05:45.460
It's not that hard.
这并不难。

1535
01:05:45.600 --> 01:05:47.360
And that's what I want to say to Jim and Pam.
这也是我想对吉姆和帕姆说的话。

1536
01:05:48.080 --> 01:05:56.380
One of the things I did love about the scene is that when Jim leaves to go to Dwight's car, he puts Stanley in charge and Stanley takes it seriously.
我喜欢这场戏的一点是，当吉姆离开去德怀特的车里时，他让斯坦利负责，而斯坦利很认真地对待了。

1537
01:05:56.660 --> 01:05:59.260
He's like, OK, Stanley's now in charge of the game.
他就像是，好吧，现在由斯坦利负责游戏了。

1538
01:05:59.940 --> 01:06:03.980
And when we cut back to the game, we don't know why.
当我们切回游戏画面时，我们不知道原因。

1539
01:06:04.120 --> 01:06:06.280
But out of the blue, Kevin just says boobs.
但凯文突然冒出一句“胸部”。

1540
01:06:06.660 --> 01:06:09.580
And Stanley says, what question are you responding to?
斯坦利问，你在回答什么问题？

1541
01:06:10.320 --> 01:06:10.520
Yes.
没错。

1542
01:06:10.520 --> 01:06:14.380
That was a little added bit in the super fan episode.
那是超级粉丝版剧集里额外加的一点内容。

1543
01:06:15.520 --> 01:06:17.000
Roy is going to come up.
罗伊要出场了。

1544
01:06:17.000 --> 01:06:24.820
You know, all the guys in the warehouse, there was a scene where they were like doing donuts and stuff and drinking beers.
你知道，仓库里的那些家伙，有一场戏是他们在那儿转圈开车之类的，还喝着啤酒。

1545
01:06:25.400 --> 01:06:28.380
And he's like, these guys are a little crazy.
他说，这些人有点疯狂。

1546
01:06:28.540 --> 01:06:30.580
Can I come hang out with you guys for a little bit?
我可以和你们待一会儿吗？

1547
01:06:30.720 --> 01:06:32.760
He says they can be real jackasses.
他说他们有时候真的很混蛋。

1548
01:06:33.120 --> 01:06:33.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1549
01:06:33.960 --> 01:06:43.100
And this is a moment where I'm like, oh, Roy, Roy, there might be something there that's sweet about Roy.
这一刻我觉得，噢，罗伊，罗伊，罗伊身上可能还是有可爱的一面的。

1550
01:06:43.300 --> 01:06:46.980
He doesn't want to just, you know, drink beer and do donuts with the jackasses.
他不想只是和那群混蛋一起喝啤酒、转圈开车。

1551
01:06:47.260 --> 01:06:48.960
He's like, that's kind of getting old.
他觉得，这有点让人厌烦了。

1552
01:06:49.440 --> 01:06:49.880
Yeah.
是啊。

1553
01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:50.180
No.
不。

1554
01:06:50.320 --> 01:06:53.680
Instead, he wants to join the game of who would you do and pick Angela.
相反，他想加入那个“你会选谁”的游戏，还选了安吉拉。

1555
01:06:53.840 --> 01:06:55.060
In front of his fiance.
当着他未婚妻的面。

1556
01:06:55.640 --> 01:06:55.860
Yeah.
没错。

1557
01:06:56.740 --> 01:06:58.200
That's not being a jackass.
那可真是个混蛋行为。

1558
01:06:58.200 --> 01:06:59.400
Good job, Roy.
干得好，罗伊。

1559
01:06:59.660 --> 01:07:03.860
Roy is not at the place yet where he's learning how to play the piano for his fiance.
罗伊还没到那种会为未婚妻学弹钢琴的境界。

1560
01:07:04.220 --> 01:07:05.300
No, he's not.
不，他还没到。

1561
01:07:05.760 --> 01:07:06.260
Exactly.
确实。

1562
01:07:08.220 --> 01:07:14.340
So everyone's going around and awkwardly shouting out who they would do when Ryan gets a call on his cell phone.
所以大家都在尴尬地轮流喊出自己想选的人，这时瑞安的手机响了。

1563
01:07:14.340 --> 01:07:17.580
And I love it so much because he's like, no, this is a good time.
我太喜欢这一段了，因为他居然说，不，现在正是时候。

1564
01:07:17.660 --> 01:07:18.500
This is a great time.
现在是绝佳时机。

1565
01:07:18.640 --> 01:07:19.160
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
是啊，是啊，是啊。

1566
01:07:19.920 --> 01:07:23.460
And then Michael is suddenly bummed that he doesn't have his cell phone.
然后迈克尔突然很沮丧，因为他没带手机。

1567
01:07:24.060 --> 01:07:26.740
Well, Dwight says, I can go back and get your cell phone.
嗯，德怀特说，我可以回去帮你拿手机。

1568
01:07:27.220 --> 01:07:28.220
I'll go in the building.
我会进大楼去拿。

1569
01:07:28.440 --> 01:07:31.460
I'll go in the burning building to get your cell phone, Michael.
我会冲进着火的大楼去帮你拿手机，迈克尔。

1570
01:07:31.920 --> 01:07:34.760
Of course, his subtext is, that's how much I love you.
当然，他的潜台词是，我有多爱你。

1571
01:07:34.980 --> 01:07:35.380
Yes.
是的。

1572
01:07:35.380 --> 01:07:38.940
And Michael, as Dwight runs in the building, Michael's like, you idiot.
当德怀特冲进大楼时，迈克尔却说，你这个白痴。

1573
01:07:39.400 --> 01:07:41.660
And Kevin says, he could die.
凯文说，他可能会死。

1574
01:07:41.780 --> 01:07:44.160
And the last thing you said to him is, idiot.
而你对他说的最后一句话竟然是，白痴。

1575
01:07:44.780 --> 01:07:45.220
Yeah.
没错。

1576
01:07:45.540 --> 01:07:46.700
That's going to weigh on Michael.
这会让迈克尔心里不好受的。

1577
01:07:47.180 --> 01:07:51.840
Well, now we have a new little scene where Jim and Ryan are discussing business school.
好了，现在我们迎来了一个新场景，吉姆和瑞安在讨论商学院的事。

1578
01:07:52.180 --> 01:07:53.480
Jim's got some questions.
吉姆有一些疑问。

1579
01:07:53.720 --> 01:08:02.640
I wonder if this is kind of coming off of that added talking head that we had earlier where Pam is saying, you're not stuck at Dunder Mifflin.
我在想这是否源于之前那个补拍的采访片段，帕姆说，你并没有被困在邓德·米夫林。

1580
01:08:02.640 --> 01:08:04.900
Like, she planted this seed.
就像是，她埋下了这颗种子。

1581
01:08:04.900 --> 01:08:06.260
You could have options.
你是有选择的。

1582
01:08:06.600 --> 01:08:06.760
Yeah.
是啊。

1583
01:08:07.440 --> 01:08:09.760
So I guess Jim's kind of looking at his options.
所以我猜吉姆在考虑他的选择。

1584
01:08:10.380 --> 01:08:12.520
Ryan says he sees it as an investment.
瑞安说他把这看作是一种投资。

1585
01:08:13.220 --> 01:08:13.540
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1586
01:08:14.300 --> 01:08:17.760
The ladies are still playing the game of who would you do.
女士们还在玩那个“你会选谁”的游戏。

1587
01:08:17.960 --> 01:08:19.760
And pretty much everyone chooses Jim.
几乎每个人都选了吉姆。

1588
01:08:20.740 --> 01:08:23.700
Pam is divided between Oscar or Toby.
帕姆在奥斯卡和托比之间犹豫不决。

1589
01:08:24.300 --> 01:08:24.460
Yep.
没错。

1590
01:08:25.100 --> 01:08:28.980
And Michael, it's really weighing on him now that Dwight's inside the building.
而迈克尔，德怀特还在大楼里，这让他感到压力很大。

1591
01:08:29.160 --> 01:08:30.920
He's like, why is Dwight taking so long?
他心想，德怀特怎么去了这么久？

1592
01:08:31.360 --> 01:08:31.500
Yeah.
是啊。

1593
01:08:32.560 --> 01:08:35.320
Katie is going to call Jim and have to step away.
凯蒂要给吉姆打电话，不得不走开一下。

1594
01:08:35.320 --> 01:08:40.880
And Michael is going to tell Ryan, call my cell phone so Dwight can find it more easily.
迈克尔让瑞安打他的手机，这样德怀特更容易找到。

1595
01:08:40.880 --> 01:08:42.340
He's been in there too long.
他在里面待得太久了。

1596
01:08:42.660 --> 01:08:45.080
And then Ryan's like, well, I don't have your number.
然后瑞安说，我没有你的号码。

1597
01:08:45.500 --> 01:08:48.500
And Michael's like, but I gave it to you back in the car.
迈克尔说，但我刚才在车里给你了啊。

1598
01:08:48.700 --> 01:08:50.140
I saw you put it in your phone.
我看到你把它存进手机里了。

1599
01:08:50.140 --> 01:08:52.660
I watched you enter it into your phone.
我亲眼看着你输进手机里的。

1600
01:08:52.900 --> 01:08:56.400
And Ryan's like, yeah, you're going to need to give it to me again.
瑞安说，好吧，你得再给我一次。

1601
01:08:57.200 --> 01:08:58.740
Cringe meter of 10.
尴尬指数满分十分。

1602
01:08:59.060 --> 01:08:59.540
Yes.
没错。

1603
01:09:00.300 --> 01:09:04.240
So Michael uses Ryan's phone to call his own phone.
所以迈克尔用瑞安的手机拨打了他自己的手机。

1604
01:09:04.400 --> 01:09:06.020
And it rings in his pocket.
然后他口袋里的手机响了。

1605
01:09:06.380 --> 01:09:06.680
Yeah.
是啊。

1606
01:09:07.140 --> 01:09:15.780
That's when Dwight comes running out of the building and he announces how this fire started.
就在这时，德怀特从大楼里跑出来，宣布了这场火灾是怎么引起的。

1607
01:09:16.520 --> 01:09:16.800
Yeah.
是啊。

1608
01:09:17.160 --> 01:09:22.080
Ryan left his cheese pita in the toaster oven and it caught on fire.
瑞安把他的奶酪皮塔饼留在烤箱里，结果着火了。

1609
01:09:22.340 --> 01:09:26.800
For the guy who didn't want to be a something guy, he's now fire guy.
