01:16:34.280 --> 01:16:36.680
Oh, I kind of jumped in at my buzzer.
噢，我好像抢先按了抢答器。

1770
01:16:36.740 --> 01:16:38.180
I hope I was the first buzzer.
希望我是第一个按的。

1771
01:16:38.320 --> 01:16:39.080
I think you were.
我想你是。

1772
01:16:39.200 --> 01:16:39.460
Okay.
好的。

1773
01:16:40.020 --> 01:16:40.840
Oh, sorry.
噢，抱歉。

1774
01:16:40.860 --> 01:16:41.420
Oh, okay.
噢，好吧。

1775
01:16:42.080 --> 01:16:47.440
In the Happy Hour episode, who beat Michael's push-up record to leave early from work?
在《欢乐时光》那一集中，是谁打破了迈克尔的俯卧撑纪录从而提前下班的？

1776
01:16:49.180 --> 01:16:49.660
Stanley.
斯坦利。

1777
01:16:49.960 --> 01:16:50.840
Sam, got it.
山姆，答对了。

1778
01:16:50.960 --> 01:16:51.440
Oh!
噢！

1779
01:16:53.060 --> 01:16:53.800
All right.
好吧。

1780
01:16:54.060 --> 01:16:55.320
Is this the last question?
这是最后一个问题吗？

1781
01:16:55.460 --> 01:16:56.480
This is the last one.
这是最后一题了。

1782
01:16:56.520 --> 01:16:57.120
All right, Jenna.
好吧，珍娜。

1783
01:16:57.480 --> 01:16:59.300
And if you get it right, then we're tied.
如果你答对了，那我们就平局了。

1784
01:16:59.300 --> 01:17:00.680
We'll have to go to a tie break.
我们就得进行加赛了。

1785
01:17:00.820 --> 01:17:01.020
Okay.
好的。

1786
01:17:01.340 --> 01:17:02.300
There's a lot at stake.
这关系重大啊。

1787
01:17:02.460 --> 01:17:02.680
Okay.
好的。

1788
01:17:03.320 --> 01:17:08.260
In the murder episode, what was the name of Michael's character in the murder mystery game?
在《谋杀》那一集中，迈克尔在谋杀之谜游戏中扮演的角色叫什么名字？

1789
01:17:10.740 --> 01:17:11.540
Oh, shoot.
噢，该死。

1790
01:17:12.920 --> 01:17:18.640
It's like a French, like Cajun name, isn't it, or something?
那是个法语名，像卡津语的名字，对吧，或者是之类的？

1791
01:17:19.540 --> 01:17:19.940
Mama.
妈妈。

1792
01:17:20.620 --> 01:17:21.740
No, that's fine.
不，没关系。

1793
01:17:25.980 --> 01:17:26.900
I got nothing.
我不知道。

1794
01:17:28.040 --> 01:17:28.500
Pass.
跳过。

1795
01:17:30.300 --> 01:17:31.220
Caleb Crawdad.
凯莱布·克劳达德。

1796
01:17:31.600 --> 01:17:33.780
Oh, I knew it was a Cajun thing.
噢，我就知道那是卡津语的东西。

1797
01:17:34.060 --> 01:17:34.760
All right.
好吧。

1798
01:17:35.060 --> 01:17:35.800
Next question.
下一题。

1799
01:17:36.560 --> 01:17:37.200
Oh, no.
噢，不。

1800
01:17:37.280 --> 01:17:37.760
Is that it?
这就结束了吗？

1801
01:17:37.860 --> 01:17:38.340
Do I win?
我赢了吗？

1802
01:17:38.340 --> 01:17:39.240
I think you won.
我想你赢了。

1803
01:17:39.540 --> 01:17:39.820
I think you won.
我想你赢了。

1804
01:17:39.820 --> 01:17:39.870
Oh.
哦。

1805
01:17:40.060 --> 01:17:40.180
Oh.
哦。

1806
01:17:40.660 --> 01:17:43.020
Well, I don't get a chance then to tie.
好吧，那我没机会打平了。

1807
01:17:43.020 --> 01:17:44.260
That was your chance.
那就是你的机会。

1808
01:17:44.460 --> 01:17:46.340
Caleb Crawdad was your chance.
凯莱布·克劳达德就是你的机会。

1809
01:17:46.820 --> 01:17:47.840
Well, Jenna, guess what?
好吧，珍娜，你猜怎么着？

1810
01:17:47.840 --> 01:17:51.780
You win the Star Wars bag of socks.
你赢得了那袋《星球大战》袜子。

1811
01:17:52.100 --> 01:17:53.440
Bag of socks.
一袋袜子。

1812
01:17:53.620 --> 01:17:54.820
Bag of socks.
一袋袜子。

1813
01:17:54.980 --> 01:17:55.500
Bag of socks.
一袋袜子。

1814
01:17:55.500 --> 01:17:56.320
Bag of socks.
一袋袜子。

1815
01:17:56.640 --> 01:17:57.280
Look at the socks.
看看这些袜子。

1816
01:17:59.880 --> 01:18:01.300
I guess I...
我想我……

1817
01:18:01.300 --> 01:18:02.400
They're amazing.
它们太棒了。

1818
01:18:02.900 --> 01:18:06.840
They are Captain Crunch and Reese's Peanut Butter Cup socks.
它们是“船长脆脆”和“瑞斯花生酱杯”图案的袜子。

1819
01:18:07.180 --> 01:18:07.560
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

1820
01:18:08.940 --> 01:18:12.980
And I guess it would have been weird if I won the gift prize that I bought.
而且我想，如果我赢了我自己买的礼物奖品，那才奇怪呢。

1821
01:18:15.440 --> 01:18:17.460
Well, thank you all for listening.
好吧，谢谢大家的收听。

1822
01:18:17.620 --> 01:18:19.180
This was a lot of fun.
这真的很有趣。

1823
01:18:19.180 --> 01:18:21.740
A big thank you to Kent Sibornak.
非常感谢肯特·西博纳克。

1824
01:18:21.940 --> 01:18:22.340
Yeah.
没错。

1825
01:18:22.540 --> 01:18:26.940
And I want to say thank you to Ken Kwapis for sharing with us his memories about this episode.
我还想感谢肯·卡皮斯与我们分享他关于这一集的记忆。

1826
01:18:27.160 --> 01:18:29.760
And I asked Ken if there's a project I could share about.
我问肯有没有什么项目可以分享一下。

1827
01:18:29.920 --> 01:18:35.940
And he said he is thrilled because he is directing all four episodes of the Malcolm in the Middle reboot.
他说他非常激动，因为他正在执导《马尔柯姆的一家》重启版的所有四集。

1828
01:18:36.160 --> 01:18:39.740
A lot of the main cast is coming back and he's really excited about it.
很多主要演员都会回归，他对此感到非常兴奋。

1829
01:18:39.860 --> 01:18:40.380
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

1830
01:18:40.500 --> 01:18:40.740
Yes.
是的。

1831
01:18:40.740 --> 01:18:41.840
I read about that.
我读到过相关报道。

1832
01:18:42.000 --> 01:18:42.800
That's so cool.
太酷了。

1833
01:18:43.120 --> 01:18:43.260
Yeah.
是啊。

1834
01:18:43.300 --> 01:18:44.680
There's some great articles about it.
有一些很棒的相关文章。

1835
01:18:44.800 --> 01:18:45.900
I'll share it in our stories.
我会把它们分享到我们的快拍里。

1836
01:18:45.900 --> 01:18:49.380
Well, everyone, thanks for joining us and we'll see you next week.
好了，各位，感谢大家的加入，我们下周见。

1837
01:18:49.560 --> 01:18:49.780
Bye.
再见。

1838
